### ===================== Microservicio vehiculos_ms (puerto 8081) =====================

### Estado del servicio
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/

### Consultar todos los vehiculos
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos

### Consultar vehiculos por estado (disponible | alquilado | mantenimiento)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos?estado=disponible

### Consultar un vehiculo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos/1

### Consultar vehiculos disponibles en una fecha
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos/disponibles/2026-12-01

### Registrar un vehiculo
POST http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Mazda",
    "modelo": "3",
    "anio": 2024,
    "categoria": "Sedan",
    "estado": "disponible"
}

### Modificar un vehiculo
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Mazda",
    "modelo": "CX-30",
    "anio": 2024,
    "categoria": "SUV",
    "estado": "disponible"
}

### Borrar un vehiculo
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8081/vehiculos/4


### ===================== Microservicio clientes_ms (puerto 8082) =====================

### Consultar todos los clientes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/clientes

### Consultar un cliente
GET http://127.0.0.1:8082/clientes/1

### Registrar un cliente
POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Ana Perez",
    "telefono": "3109998877",
    "correo": "ana@test.com",
    "numero_licencia": "LIC-2001"
}

### Modificar un cliente
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8082/clientes/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Ana Maria Perez",
    "telefono": "3109998877",
    "correo": "ana.maria@test.com",
    "numero_licencia": "LIC-2001"
}

### Borrar un cliente
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8082/clientes/3


### ===================== Microservicio reservas_ms (puerto 8083) =====================

### Consultar todas las reservas
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas

### Historial de un cliente
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas?cliente_id=1

### Historial de un vehiculo
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas?vehiculo_id=1

### Consultar una reserva
GET http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas/1

### Registrar una reserva
POST http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cliente_id": 1,
    "vehiculo_id": 1,
    "fecha_inicio": "2026-12-01",
    "fecha_fin": "2026-12-05"
}

### Devolver un vehiculo (reserva => completada)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas/1/devolver

### Cancelar una reserva (reserva => cancelada)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8083/reservas/1/cancelar
